# Token Efficiency Rules
- DO NOT rewrite entire files. Provide highly targeted diffs or surgical modifications.
- Keep components modular, isolated, and under 60 lines of code where possible.
- Separate raw copy/informational text from codebase architecture. Suggest moving static text to `.md` or `.json` content files.
- Prioritize standard vanilla solutions before importing heavy external libraries.
- Keep conversation responses concise and omit conversational filler.